the deep canyon brush.

632
00:25:04,203 --> 00:25:06,840
Can't imagine
an honest man living down there.

633
00:25:06,873 --> 00:25:08,040
- No, neither can I.

634
00:25:08,073 --> 00:25:09,008
Let's go.

635
00:25:09,042 --> 00:25:10,977
- Go?
- Yeah, go.

636
00:25:11,010 --> 00:25:12,545
- We have to get him,
don't we?

637
00:25:12,578 --> 00:25:14,680
- Oh, oh, go.

638
00:25:14,713 --> 00:25:17,283
- I guess we do.
I'll just get my horse.

639
00:25:17,317 --> 00:25:18,885
- Since we're going...

640
00:25:20,953 --> 00:25:23,223
- Hey, Cane,
who is the girl?

641
00:25:25,958 --> 00:25:28,395
- Hey watch,
your hands are cold.

642
00:25:28,428 --> 00:25:29,695
[Horse snorts]

643
00:25:32,032 --> 00:25:34,667
- Hey, I love what
you're driving, Pinto, right?

644
00:25:37,237 --> 00:25:39,672
- Let's ride separately,
I just feel more comfortable

645
00:25:39,705 --> 00:25:41,575
if we rode separately.

646
00:25:41,608 --> 00:25:42,775
- I'm winning.

647
00:25:44,410 --> 00:25:46,378
- Oh no, I'm winning.

648
00:25:46,412 --> 00:25:47,680
- Yeah, I'll let you go.

649
00:25:52,185 --> 00:25:54,387
- You wait here.
I'll look around.

650
00:25:57,190 --> 00:25:58,458
- No, where's he going?

651
00:25:58,492 --> 00:25:59,927
I'm as nervous
as a long tail cat

652
00:25:59,960 --> 00:26:02,862
in a room full of
rocking chairs.

653
00:26:02,895 --> 00:26:04,863
- Sir, you got a permit?

654
00:26:04,897 --> 00:26:06,967
I notice you don't have
a ticket on your post,

655
00:26:07,000 --> 00:26:09,368
hello, sir.

656
00:26:11,503 --> 00:26:14,873
- Oh, come on, everyone knows
that there are no hot plates

657
00:26:14,907 --> 00:26:17,510
allowed in Nine Mile Canyon.

658
00:26:19,980 --> 00:26:21,615
- Now, where are you going?

659
00:26:21,648 --> 00:26:23,148
[Crying]

660
00:26:23,182 --> 00:26:24,617
Stay with me.

661
00:26:24,650 --> 00:26:26,052
- Hell, there's three bowls
of porridge here,

662
00:26:26,085 --> 00:26:27,787
